{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Xenoterrestrial",
    "steam_appid": 2623100,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XENOTERRESTRIAL is a game about a man whose xenophobia is not so much earthly as it about extraterrestrials. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This top-down technical shooter, in the spirit of games like Hotline Miami and Ultrakill combines skill with strategy for a fast paced, challenging experience. A combination of a wealth of complex yet easy to learn mechanics and a great deal of customization make this an absolute must play for fans of technical shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features Include</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >7 Weapons to Use In tandem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive customization (5 mods available for each weapon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several other cooldown-based mechanics (gear collected by the player)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A central narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex and diverse set of enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different difficulties for players of all ability (or those who are just looking for a different experience)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance related settings adjustments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex, technical mechanics reminiscent of games like Ultrakill and Doom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret levels and skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewarding rank and leveling systems that encourage both progression and replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A style points system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Does the Game Include Right Now?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At present, Xenoterrestrial includes the first two chapters, and a unique and challenging endless mode. A third chapter is coming soon!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XENOTERRESTRIAL is a game about a man whose xenophobia is not so much earthly as it about extraterrestrials. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This top-down technical shooter, in the spirit of games like Hotline Miami and Ultrakill combines skill with strategy for a fast paced, challenging experience. A combination of a wealth of complex yet easy to learn mechanics and a great deal of customization make this an absolute must play for fans of technical shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features Include</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >7 Weapons to Use In tandem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive customization (5 mods available for each weapon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several other cooldown-based mechanics (gear collected by the player)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A central narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex and diverse set of enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different difficulties for players of all ability (or those who are just looking for a different experience)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance related settings adjustments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex, technical mechanics reminiscent of games like Ultrakill and Doom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret levels and skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewarding rank and leveling systems that encourage both progression and replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A style points system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Does the Game Include Right Now?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At present, Xenoterrestrial includes the first two chapters, and a unique and challenging endless mode. A third chapter is coming soon!</p>",
    "short_description": "Unleash hell as a xeno-hating soldier aboard a ship being hijacked by a hitherto undiscovered alien race. Xenoterrestrial is a top-down technical shooter that combines skill and strategy for a fast-paced, challenging experience offering customizable weapons, complex mechanics, and diverse enemies.",
